{"id":31397171470,"name":"Test","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAHT2rRDg","head_branch":"l2-cache-audit-async-race","head_sha":"1166c2c4e7e5f64c035d9220c85d342b31ab9650","path":".github/workflows/run-tests.yml","run_number":55548,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"fix: resolve tracked entity audit values on the caller thread [DHIS2-21964]","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":10954,"check_suite_id":85159165799,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAT0-G_Zw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31397171470","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31397171470","created_at":"2026-08-10T14:15:29Z","updated_at":"2026-08-10T14:24:22Z","run_started_at":"2026-08-10T14:15:29Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31397171470/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31397171470/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/85159165799","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31397171470/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31397171470/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/31397171470/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: resolve tracked entity audit values on the caller thread [DHIS2-21964]\n\nThe tracked entity audit write is @Async, and the caller passed a managed\nTrackedEntity across that boundary. The async thread then dereferenced\ngetTrackedEntityType().isAllowAuditLog(), but a Hibernate session is not\nthread-safe and is usually already closed by then, so the call threw\nLazyInitializationException. SimpleAsyncUncaughtExceptionHandler swallows it,\nso the read succeeded while its audit record was silently dropped.\n\nMeasured on a 16-thread integration harness against Postgres at the default\npool size: of 960 concurrent reads only 152 audits were written with the L2\ncache on, and none at all with it off. With the values resolved on the caller\nthread all 960 reads produce their audit record in both configurations.\n\nThe same cross-thread session access also corrupted the caller's connection\nstate when the L2 cache was off, producing \"Cannot change transaction\nread-only property in the middle of a transaction\" and \"This statement has\nbeen closed\". That is the failure that made integration tests flaky whenever\nthey ran genuinely cache-off, and it blocked recommending the cache off-switch\nas a diagnostic.\n\nResolve the uid and isAllowAuditLog() on the caller thread, where the owning\nsession is open, and hand only immutable TrackedEntityAudit values to a small\ndedicated @Async writer bean. A separate bean is required because Spring\napplies @Async through a proxy, so a self-invocation would run synchronously.\n\nAI Assisted","author":{"name":"Morten Svanaes","email":"netroms@gmail.com"},"id":"1166c2c4e7e5f64c035d9220c85d342b31ab9650","tree_id":"2d5257dc36fefee386551f967956cd6550721386","timestamp":"2026-08-10T14:14:50Z","committer":{"name":"Morten Svanaes","email":"netroms@gmail.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/us